WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:06.750
Your legacy system still runs the business. It also blocks integrations, AI and growth.

2
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.400
Rewriting everything at once is the riskiest move you can make.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.750
There's a better way: modernize without starting over.

4
00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:20.750
First, AI agents analyze the legacy system, mapping code, data, dependencies and business rules.

5
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:26.250
Then we document the architecture in diagrams and plain language your team can validate.

6
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:31.750
We extract APIs that expose core functions securely.

7
00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:37.750
We build a modern web and mobile frontend on top of those APIs.

8
00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:43.250
We connect AI capabilities, like assistants and document processing, without touching the core.

9
00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:49.750
And we replace old components gradually, one module at a time, until the system is composable and cloud-ready.

10
00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:53.400
AI makes the slowest part fast.

11
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.750
Dependency mapping drops from about a week of work to a few hours, and McKinsey reports gen AI cut one bank's mainframe migration estimate by 40 percent.

12
00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:02.750
The business keeps running, and every release delivers value.

13
00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:07.400
Start with a two-to-four-week Modernization Assessment, with nearshore teams in your time zone.

14
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:11.750
TEAM International.
